# Patches that must NOT exist in this directory any more.
#
# One file name per line (bare, no leading comment marker). A bare line is
# checked; lines starting with # are notes. apply-zephyr-patches.sh fails if a
# listed file is present: the pinned revision has the fix, so re-applying it
# would either do nothing or land a stale hunk in a tree nobody looks at.
#
#   ESP32 SPI line mode was truncated to 16 bits, so SPI_LINES_QUAD was
#   silently dropped and every quad transfer went out on D0. Fixed upstream by
#   24cc93286, which the v4.5.0 pin contains. Retired 2026-11-19 with the pin
#   move from v4.4.1+zmk-fixes.
0001-spi-esp32-fix-quad-line-mode-truncated-to-16-bit.patch
